OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 30 APR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Saint-Saens
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod follows Saint-
OL,6,     GSaens through a period shaped by
OL,7,     Gexile, opportunity and an
OL,8,     Gunexpected marriage, as his
OL,9,     Gcreative focus shifts towards the
OL,10,     Gstage.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GLIve music from pianist Gabriela
OL,13,     GMontero.
OL,14,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,15,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,16,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,17,     Gfavourites, including music by
OL,18,     GSchubert, Mozart, and Steve Reich.
